<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.badge.title")}
        description="Badge 是 RML 的徽标组件，包裹子节点显示计数、小红点或图标徽标。支持 count/max、dot、icon 三种展示模式。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>变体 variants</h3>
                <p>三种 variant 通过属性切换：count 属性设置 Number variant（默认），dot 属性切换为 Dot variant（小红点），icon 属性切换为 Icon variant（图标徽标）。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Badge count="5">
                        <Avatar name="Alice" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge count="0">
                        <Avatar name="Bob" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge count="100" max="9">
                        <Avatar name="Carol" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge count="200">
                        <Avatar name="Dave" />
                    </Badge>
                </div>
                <p>count=0 时徽标隐藏（Bob）；count=100 max=9 显示 9+（Carol）；count=200 默认 max=99 显示 99+（Dave）。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>Dot variant</h3>
                <p>dot 属性切换为 Dot variant，显示一个小红点，常用于有新内容提示。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Badge dot="">
                        <Avatar name="Eve" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge dot="">
                        <Avatar name="Frank" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge dot="" size="large">
                        <Avatar name="Grace" />
                    </Badge>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>Icon variant</h3>
                <p>icon 属性切换为 Icon variant，在右下角显示图标徽标。值为 IconName 枚举变体名（如 Bell、Check、Star）。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Badge icon="Bell">
                        <Avatar name="Heidi" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge icon="Check" size="large">
                        <Avatar name="Ivan" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge icon="Star">
                        <Avatar name="Judy" />
                    </Badge>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>尺寸 size</h3>
                <p>size 属性控制徽标大小：xsmall / small / medium / large。来自 Sizable trait。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Badge count="5" size="xsmall">
                        <Avatar name="A" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge count="5" size="small">
                        <Avatar name="B" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge count="5" size="medium">
                        <Avatar name="C" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge count="5" size="large">
                        <Avatar name="D" />
                    </Badge>
                </div>
                <p>注：在 gpui-component 底层实现中，Size::Small 与 Size::XSmall 共用同一尺寸分支（10px），视觉等价。Medium（默认，16px）与 Large（24px）有显著差异。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>动态绑定（computed + if 条件渲染）</h3>
                <p>点击按钮递增 count，当 count 大于 max_val 时显示 N+（演示 computed 条件逻辑）；切换 variant 演示 if 条件渲染。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Badge dot="" if={is_dot}>
                        <Avatar name="Dynamic" />
                    </Badge>
                    <Badge count={count} if={!is_dot} max={max_val}>
                        <Avatar name="Dynamic" />
                    </Badge>
                </div>
                <p>当前 variant: {variant_label} | count: {count} | max_val: {max_val} | 显示: {count_display}</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="count +1" primary on-click={on_increment} />
                    <Button label="count +10" on-click={on_increment_10} />
                    <Button label="reset" on-click={on_reset} />
                    <Button label="切换 Number/Dot" on-click={on_toggle_dot} />
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>

        <template slot="api">
            <h3>Badge</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <p>另：size 属性来自 Sizable trait，disabled 等通用属性对所有组件生效。</p>
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
